dist-ssr
# The shared workspace target dir. The cargo root is the repo root since T4 (the
# root `Cargo.toml` holds the `[workspace]`), so `target/` lives here, not under
# `src-tauri/`. `src-tauri/.gitignore` keeps its own `/target/` rule on purpose: a
# stray `cd src-tauri && cargo build` (still legal — it is a member) recreates a
# nested target dir, and that rule is what keeps it ignored.
/target
*.local

